{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spooky Monkey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A meditative adventure with a monkey from beyond the grave.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about a small monkey brought back from death to settle unfinished business with a mysterious, malevolent force. While that might sound like the setup for something super edgy, <strong>Spooky Monkey</strong> isn't so intense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, it\u2019s a calm, contemplative experience focused on exploration, subtle storytelling, and solving poetic, koan-like riddles. Think less <i>high-octane combat</i> and more <i>peaceful reflection </i>with a touch of the supernatural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll dash and roll through haunted ruins, past ghostly figures and undead creatures, not with panic, but with quiet purpose. Accompanied by soothing, atmospheric music, Spooky Monkey invites you to slow down, breathe, and enjoy the moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a game designed to keep you hooked for hours or leave your heart racing. It\u2019s meant to bring you peace. After playing, you might just feel more grounded than when you started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander the <strong>Cemetery of Fallen Heroes</strong>, uncover secrets at your own pace, and solve riddles that are as much about insight as they are about progress. And yes, you\u2019ll be doing all this as an undead <strong>Japanese macaque</strong>, brought back from the other side. (Fans of <i>Mist Monkey</i> may recognize this hero... now zombified)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What the game doesn't have:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No intentionally addictive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No high tension music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No procedurally generated world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated crafting system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4066560?t=1766233625","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066560/ee7c67ccb614c5eaf0a33410ff49ff929fa259a2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766233625","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066560/dbf0f435bedd2944b24b2619244f8f8cb463260d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766233625","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066560/dbf0f435bedd2944b24b2619244f8f8cb463260d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766233625","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spooky Monkey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A meditative adventure with a monkey from beyond the grave.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about a small monkey brought back from death to settle unfinished business with a mysterious, malevolent force. While that might sound like the setup for something super edgy, <strong>Spooky Monkey</strong> isn't so intense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, it\u2019s a calm, contemplative experience focused on exploration, subtle storytelling, and solving poetic, koan-like riddles. Think less <i>high-octane combat</i> and more <i>peaceful reflection </i>with a touch of the supernatural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll dash and roll through haunted ruins, past ghostly figures and undead creatures, not with panic, but with quiet purpose. Accompanied by soothing, atmospheric music, Spooky Monkey invites you to slow down, breathe, and enjoy the moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a game designed to keep you hooked for hours or leave your heart racing. It\u2019s meant to bring you peace. After playing, you might just feel more grounded than when you started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander the <strong>Cemetery of Fallen Heroes</strong>, uncover secrets at your own pace, and solve riddles that are as much about insight as they are about progress. And yes, you\u2019ll be doing all this as an undead <strong>Japanese macaque</strong>, brought back from the other side. (Fans of <i>Mist Monkey</i> may recognize this hero... now zombified)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What the game doesn't have:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No intentionally addictive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No high tension music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No procedurally generated world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated crafting system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Xander Clinthorne"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066560/ed95fa35f78766122e03210553d7633bb66f571e/header.jpg?t=1766233625","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4066560/1557262653/4b1dcf168b304df4878a250c33c7b482b235f8b1/1760156975/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760671654","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4066560/1557262653/4b1dcf168b304df4878a250c33c7b482b235f8b1/1760156975/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760671654","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4066560/1557262653/4b1dcf168b304df4878a250c33c7b482b235f8b1/1760156975/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760671654","id":257215938,"name":"Spooky Monkey Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257215938/66c57880ffe26a92beac6868d6bcaae6e